= Math Unit Tests

== Fraction
$ frac(a, b) $

== Square Root
$ sqrt(x) $

== Cube Root
$ root(3, x) $

== Subscript Only
$ x_i $

== Superscript Only
$ x^2 $

== Both Sub and Super
$ x_i^2 $

== Summation with Limits
$ sum_(i=1)^n i $

== Product
$ product_(k=1)^n k $

== Integral
$ integral_0^1 f(x) dif x $

== Nested Fraction
$ frac(frac(a, b), c) $

== Greek Letters
$ alpha + beta + gamma $

== Matrix
$ mat(1, 2; 3, 4) $

== Accent Hat
$ hat(x) $

== Accent Arrow
$ arrow(v) $

== Accent Tilde
$ tilde(a) $

== Overline
$ overline(A B) $

== Underline
$ underline(x + y) $

== Named Function Sin
$ sin(x) $

== Named Function Lim
$ lim_(n -> infinity) a_n $

== Cases
$ f(x) = cases(
  x^2 &"if" x > 0,
  -x &"if" x <= 0
) $

== Underbrace
$ underbrace(1 + 2 + dots.c + n, n "terms") $

== Overbrace
$ overbrace(a + b + c, "sum") $

== Vector
$ vec(1, 2, 3) $
